@startuml ClassFigure.Developer
' 開発者版（TowerDefenceGame.Developer）のクラス図。
' 製品版（TowerDefenceGame）の型は、ここでは外部のものとして名前だけ載せる。製品版のクラス図は ../TowerDefenceGame/ClassFigure.pu。

skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide empty members

package "TowerDefenceGame（製品版）" <<external>> {
  class GameLauncher
  class MainForm
  class GameCanvas
  class AppController
  class GameController
  class Game
  class World
  class WaveManager
  class Tower
}

package "TowerDefenceGame.Developer" {
  class Program <<static>> {
    - {static} Main() : void
  }
  note bottom of Program
    GameLauncher.Run に、開発者用の記録ファイルと
    DeveloperController を渡して起動する
  end note

  class DeveloperController {
    - _settings : DeveloperSettings
    - _tracker : CombatTracker
    - _painter : DeveloperPainter
    - _bot : AutoPlayer
    - _window : DeveloperWindow
    - Toggle() : void
    - OnGameLoaded(game : Game) : void
    - OnTicked(realDelta : float) : void
  }
  note bottom of DeveloperController
    製品版の汎用イベントだけを使って機能を足す：
    GameController.GameLoaded / Ticked、GameCanvas.OverlayPainting、MainForm.KeyDown（F12）
  end note

  class DeveloperWindow {
    + BotEnabled : bool { get; }
    + event EnemyCountMultiplierChanged : Action<float>
    + event CloseRequested : Action
    + event BotEnabledChanged : Action<bool>
    + event UnlockAllLevelsChanged : Action<bool>
    + SetUnlockAllLevels(unlockAll : bool) : void
    + SetMultiplier(multiplier : float) : void
    + ShowStats(game : Game?, selected : Tower?, tracker : CombatTracker) : void
    + ShowBot(status : string, log : IReadOnlyList<string>, logVersion : int) : void
  }

  class DeveloperPainter {
    + Draw(renderer : IRenderer, game : Game, tracker : CombatTracker) : void
  }
  note bottom of DeveloperPainter : 攻撃タワーの上に総ダメージ、左上に敵数の倍率を描く

  class CombatTracker {
    + Attach(game : Game) : void
    + For(tower : Tower) : CombatStats
  }
  note bottom of CombatTracker : World.EnemyDamaged・EnemyKilled（Enemy.LastHitBy）・Game.Updated から集計

  class CombatStats {
    + TotalDamage : long
    + WaveDamage : long
    + Kills : int
    + ActiveSeconds : float
    + DamagePerSecond : float
  }

  class DeveloperSettings {
    + EnemyCountMultiplier : float
    + UnlockAllLevels : bool
  }

  class DeveloperSettingsStore {
    + Load() : DeveloperSettings
    + Save(settings : DeveloperSettings) : void
  }

  class DeveloperPaths <<static>> {
    + {static} Progress : string
    + {static} Settings : string
  }
}

package "TowerDefenceGame.Developer.Bot" {
  class AutoPlayer {
    + Enabled : bool
    + Status : string
    + Log : IReadOnlyList<string>
    + Update(game : Game, realDelta : float) : void
  }
  note bottom of AutoPlayer
    目標火力 ＝ 次のウェーブの総HP × 余裕の倍率（1.6〜3.0、漏れたら上げる）。
    建設・強化の候補を見積もり、1Gあたり一番守りが強くなる手を選ぶ。
    余裕があれば金鉱・貯金、最終ウェーブ前は使い切る
  end note

  class DefenseEvaluator {
    + Evaluate(layout : IReadOnlyList<BotTower>, wave : WaveProfile) : DefenseScore
  }
  class RouteSamples
  class BotTower <<record>>
  class WaveProfile
  class DefenseScore <<record struct>>
}

Program ..> GameLauncher : Run
Program ..> DeveloperController : <<create>>
DeveloperController --> GameController
DeveloperController --> AppController : Progress.UnlockAllLevels / RefreshStageSelect
DeveloperController --> MainForm
DeveloperController ..> GameCanvas : OverlayPainting
DeveloperController *-- DeveloperWindow
DeveloperController *-- DeveloperPainter
DeveloperController *-- CombatTracker
DeveloperController *-- AutoPlayer
DeveloperController --> DeveloperSettingsStore
CombatTracker *-- CombatStats
CombatTracker ..> World : イベント購読
AutoPlayer ..> Game : 建設・強化・ウェーブ開始
AutoPlayer *-- DefenseEvaluator
DefenseEvaluator --> RouteSamples
DefenseEvaluator ..> BotTower
DefenseEvaluator ..> WaveProfile

@enduml
